{"id":24932,"author":"AbusiveUser","body":"Hello! after a month without activity, I'm going to present a new map called '\u003cb\u003eLago Swamp'\u003c/b\u003e for the new gamemode 'Sky Wars'. I built this map with some friends and we really hope you like the map.\u003cbr\u003eI wanted to make something different and unusual. This map is inspired in other Sky Wars maps. And every map I make, I added some easter eggs so try to find them xd\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eIslands:\u003cbr\u003e\u003cul style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 12px 25px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003ePrimary Islands\u003c/b\u003e: You will find 8 islands with 2 chests.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eMidline Islands\u003c/b\u003e: You will find 2 Mid Islands where you can find a lot of chests and one enchanting table.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cimg src=\"http://i.imgur.com/p929bvR.png\" title=\"Image: http://i.imgur.com/p929bvR.png\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eCreators:\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003eAbusiveCupcakez\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eContributors:\u003c/b\u003e Xuph, stxne, joelmce, AbusiveProdigy\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eServer hosted by:\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;Avicus Network\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eGamemode:\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eSky Wars\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eRecommended Size:\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cul style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 12px 25px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px;\"\u003eFFA: 8 players per Island\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eBuilding Time:\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;1 day\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eFeedback:\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;Legoche\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e- - - - - - - - - - - - - -\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cul style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 12px 25px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px;\"\u003eFull Imgur Album:\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\"http://imgur.com/a/U7KCN\" title=\"Link: http://imgur.com/a/U7KCN\"\u003ehttp://imgur.com/a/U7KCN\u003c/a\u003e\u003cb